    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i've been getting these really intense headaches lately, like a massive migraine. but today one was weird... my speech felt kinda thick/slurred when i was talking to my wife and i noticed the left side of my mouth was drooping a bit. is that just like a bad migraine aura or something? i dont really want to go to the er if it's just a migraine",
