    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i've had migraines for years and they get pretty crazy, sometimes i feel dizzy or see spots. it feels way more like my usual migraine than anything else actually. bell's palsy or a stroke seems like a huge jump for just a headache, right? can't i just take some extra ibuprofen and wait to see if the drooping goes away on its own?",
