      "content": "but i really dont want to pay the bill for an er visit if it's just a migraine aura. my doctor said before that auras can be really weird. if i just take a higher dose of some anti-inflammatories or maybe some of my old prescription meds, can i just stay home and monitor it for a few hours? like if the drooping is gone in an hour does that mean i'm fine?",
